# Docker / infra

- Compose services: app (Next.js), postgres, proxy (Caddy). Postgres on internal network only.
- Persist postgres data and game files via named volumes; do not bake game assets into app image.
- Env vars via .env (gitignored); provide .env.example with keys only, no real values.
- Do not open Postgres port publicly. Assume Cloudflare proxy in front of VPS.
- Backup strategy: pg_dump cron — do not assume managed DB backups.
